Upstream: https://github.com/Donchitos/Claude-Code-Game-Studios @ 05ad7c8 (Release 1.2.0, 2026-10-19)
Vendored into Grodius: 2026-10-31 (commit 90bb5f8), adapted for an engine-less TypeScript/Canvas/Vite/Capacitor game.

Before an upstream upgrade, diff against 05ad7c8 and re-apply the changes below.
This list covers the knowledge layer (agents, rules, docs). Scripts, hooks,
settings, project.yaml and skills were adapted separately; their changes are in
the git history of the same commit series (git log -- .claude/scripts .claude/hooks .claude/skills).

